# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# N2 (TIMED, the SWITCHABLE LINE of the candidate): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-nogrid13 = the candidate WITHOUT QWEN_FAST_GRID13 (the 13x10 matmul
# grids), as a gate-only profile. Against L2 it answers whether the grids pay inside the whole stack: they are default-off, exact by argument and by audit (A1 audits them)
# and their own decode ABAB (the M1 programme's F2 window) decides them standalone. TIMED: the ARC runner sets are at ZERO for this job (ORDER.txt, ARC-ZERO); no build, no
# CI push, no other job beside it. READ: c2_smoke_check clean AND octo_judge clean on c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-nogrid13; then the pair: python3
# scripts/ci/octo3_report.py --control-a <N1 smoke> --arm-a <L1 smoke> --control-b <N2 smoke> --arm-b <L2 smoke> --arm-container <L1 container> --arm-container <L2
# container> --profile c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-traffic-s4 (here the CONTROL is the no-grid boot and the arm the candidate: a GAIN means the grids
# win; the report prints UNREAD for concurrent8_code_128k_long, which the no-grid boots do not run). DECISION: a LOSS or a PARITY on both pairs means delete the
# QWEN_FAST_GRID13 line from the ship entry of scripts/ci/fusion-wp/S4.json, regenerate (make_fusion_profiles.py, make_ship4_profiles.py, make_ship4_jobs.py) and re-run
# only the gates that read the changed profile (A1 and G1 at least). TELEMETRY (C2_TELEMETRY=1, scripts/ci/card_telemetry.py): the read-only ARC sidecar samples every chip
# once a second through the smoke step; read telemetry-smoke/telemetry-summary.txt beside the result, and the first [TELEMETRY] line must say decode check ok. A gain that
# comes with a different loaded AICLK between the arms is the clocks, not the lever. Duration (estimate): 40 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-nogrid13
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k_long
C2_TELEMETRY=1
C2_BOX_MINUTES=70
